{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263HuCdmlEVt1794823146.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產康怡康安街分行首席分區營業經理楊文傑表示，鰂魚涌君豪峰錄本月首宗買賣成交，分行促成單位為低層B室，實用面積290平方呎，採1房間隔，向東北，望樓景，最新以570萬元成交，折合實用呎價19,655元。<br/>楊文傑表示，新買家為投資客，看好屋苑地理位置優越，客源穩定且租務有保證。預計單位月租可達2萬至2.1萬元，租金回報料達4.2至4.4厘。據悉，原業主於2018年8月以706萬元購入單位，持貨8年，是次轉手賬面蝕讓136萬元，單位貶值19.3%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:16:22.882170+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T18:57:34.155361+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:09:38.390810+00:00","content_hash":"4f7f07873adccd136c87e1397f7df174ab6e387ab6387f2ff93b316f69e21461","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:16:22.882170+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}